<title>UK: Ontario Hydro sets 50 billion yen Dec 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Ontario Hydro sets 50 billion yen Dec 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual-currency Samurai bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ONTARIO HYDRO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PROVINCE OF ONTARIO</p>
<p> AMT    50 BLN YEN    COUPON    *5.45 PCT  MATURITY    07.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   L06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  150 BP    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*PAYABLE IN YEN, REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC   125 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	HOLDERS RECEIVE AT MATURITY A$5,680.52 FOR EACH</p>
<p>		500,000 YEN FACE VALUE BOND.</p>
<p>		SUBSCRIPTION PERIOD NOV 21 TO DEC 5.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
